            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. An employee with two (2) years or more of Bargaining Unit Seniority may displace the least-senior employee in a next lower-paid directly-related Job Classification in the same class of work within the Bargaining Unit under the conditions outlined below:",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                83,
                715,
                178
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 0,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    137.0,
                    83.0
                ],
                [
                    715.0,
                    83.0
                ],
                [
                    715.0,
                    178.0
                ],
                [
                    137.0,
                    178.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Provided the employee is unable to exercise displacement rights into a lower paid previously-held Job Classification; or provided the next lower-paid, directly related Job Classification is higher paid than the employee's last lower-paid previously-held Job Classification; and",
            "block_bbox": [
                162,
                192,
                715,
                305
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    162.0,
                    192.0
                ],
                [
                    715.0,
                    192.0
                ],
                [
                    715.0,
                    305.0
                ],
                [
                    162.0,
                    305.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) Provided the employee has demonstrated that he or she has the ability, skill and qualifications to perform such directly related work. Provided the employee meets these required conditions, he or she shall be assigned by the Employer where he or she can best be utilized and in accordance with available work and skill requirements.",
            "block_bbox": [
                162,
                314,
                716,
                444
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    162.0,
                    314.0
                ],
                [
                    716.0,
                    314.0
                ],
                [
                    716.0,
                    444.0
                ],
                [
                    162.0,
                    444.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. An employee whose Job Title has grade levels, i.e., Sr., A, B, or C, may in the event of layoff exercise his or her seniority in a lower grade of the same Job Title.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                459,
                715,
                534
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
